  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and variance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> observations were calculated as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math> respectively by a student who took by mistake <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math>&nbsp;instead of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;for one observation. Then, the correct standard deviation is _______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;and mean&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn></math></p><p>Now new sum will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>140</mn></math></p><p>So, actual mean&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>140</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>new</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub></math></p><p>Now finding variance&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2400</mn></math></p><p>Removing observation of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>625</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2400</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1775</mn></math></p><p>Now adding observation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>actual</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub></math></p><p>Now calculating actual standard deviation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>&#963;</mi><mrow><mi>actual</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>actual</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msub><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>new</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2000</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>196</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Calculating standard deviation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>actual</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
